<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπειρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ripe</i>, of fruit, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.6.9
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				40.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.185
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); of girls, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέαι</span>,
				v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				896
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρθένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Comp.Lyc.Num.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				15
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλέουσι πέπειρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.9
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of
			persons, <i>mild</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπειροτέρους γεγονότας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					9.49
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νοῦσος</span> a disease <i>come to its
				crisis</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				39
			</span></i> ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπειρότερον πτύελον</span>
			<i>more concocted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.3.4
			</span></i>.</div>
